      <guid>https://www.gcores.com/articles/220573</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <thumb>https://image.gcores.com/fbe917126acfd2b9338399625066da59-750-500.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_fill,w_626,h_292/quality,q_90</thumb>
    </item>
<item>
      <title>R星公布《GTA》在线模式“万圣节惊悚狂欢”详情</title>
      <link>https://www.gcores.com/articles/220571</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.gcores.com/262e5539471d93eb3f563a86beb8a3a2-1920-1080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_fill,w_626,h_292/quality,q_90" /><p>R星于日前公布了GTA在线模式“万圣节惊悚狂欢”的详情。这个万圣节，洛圣都街头诡影重重，超自然异象接连出现，更有各种怪事轮番上演。即日起，玩家可迎接整整一个月的恐怖狂欢：复仇心切的杀人狂正在街头巷尾游荡，而鲁登道夫墓地已被成群结队的不死族占领。</p><div>
<figure><img src="https://image.gcores.com/646003b6406973c299a3b54f61a2b64d-960-311.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10" alt=""></figure></div><p>在“幽灵曝光”中追踪已故科技高管留下的诡异幻象，再投身万圣节精选系列，在你死我活的“杀人狂”中拼命求生，亦可驰骋于“圣安地列斯超级系列”，或在万圣节生存战中迎战邪]]></description>
      <author>YT17</author>
      <guid>https://www.gcores.com/articles/220571</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 09:20:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <thumb>https://image.gcores.com/262e5539471d93eb3f563a86beb8a3a2-1920-1080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_fill,w_626,h_292/quality,q_90</thumb>
    </item>
<item>
